# Constructor injection

Repositories, use cases, datasources, and blocs take dependencies as constructor parameters. `get<T>()` is for widgets and `App`.

```dart
@Injectable()
class LoadNewsUC {
  LoadNewsUC(this._newsRepository, this._favoritesRepository);

  final NewsRepository _newsRepository;
  final FavoritesRepository _favoritesRepository;
}
```

- Store deps in `final` fields. Prefer positional constructor args, matching existing use cases.
- Keep constructors synchronous. Async setup belongs in `@PostConstruct`.
- Annotate the class so `di.config.dart` registers it. Run `melos run build_runner` after new types.
